# Jujutsu VCS
.jj

# External consumer fixture build artifacts
fixture/.zig-cache/
fixture/zig-out/

# QEMU core dumps from cross-target test runs. The NaN-trap probe ABORTS by
# design — that is the contract the reproducers test — so every cross-target
# run writes one of these per trap, about 67 MB each. They are build
# artifacts, not source, and the 1 MB size guard refuses them anyway, which
# blocks any commit in the tree until they are deleted by hand.
qemu_*.core
core
core.*
